window.products.push({"id":1046085,"name":"Sooupowly Cooling Blanket Cal King Size 100 Percent Lightweight Cold Bamboo Blanket Ultra Soft Breathable Cool Blanket for Hot Sleepers Night Sweats (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zDhy0jXvS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Hello,Welcome to Sooupowly StoreCooling blanket is a perfect lightweight blanket for all seasons. The way bamboo bedding can keep you warm enough without causing you to wake up overheated and sweating during the night!Characteristics1.1100 Percent natural cooling microfiber. The Natural bamboo fabric features a high specific heat capacity which will keep you cool through the night.2.This blanket is thinner and more breathable, softer, and not shrink. Bring you coolness and comfort on the hot summer nights.3.Our cooling blanket with unique honeycomb pattern design.Thickness only 0.04 inches. The surface of the blanket has 113,900 super breathable honeycomb patterns.SpecificationTwin35x39IN / 90x100CMTwin XL39x47IN / 100x120CMFull39x59IN / 100x150CMQueen59x79IN / 150x200CMKing71x79IN / 180x200CMCal King79x91IN / 200x230CMPackage Included1 x Cooling BlanketNotes1.It can be machine washed and hand wash.2.It is recommended to pack it in a laundry bag to avoid entanglement or damage of lines and keep your blanket bright and clean.3.Please DO NOT bleach,iron,dry in a dryer or expose in the sun.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zDhy0jXvS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sooupowly","source_asin":"B097XV4N5Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1046085","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097XV4N5Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097XV4N5Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1046086,"name":"Cieltown Weighted Blanket for Adult Woman and Man (Navy Blue Blanket, 60\"x80\" 20lbs)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Z5vKpFTuL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"BOTH PREMIUM WEIGHTED BLANKET and MATCHED COVER ARE AVAILABLE IN OUR STORE, PURCHASE TOGETHER TO HAVE A DISCOUNT. RECOMMENDED WEIGHT/SIZE The weight of the blanket you order should be 7%-13% of your weight, which would make the most of the blanket. Due to its weight, it’s not necessary to choose oversized blanket. Recommend 48'' x 72'' for twin bed, 60'' x 80'' for queen bed. ABOUT WASHING Our weighted blankets are machine washable, But we don't recommend machine wash because it's too heavy and We're afraid it might damage your washing machine. The best way for you to use it with a duvet cover, then you can just take the cover off for a quick wash and dry. Don't wash the blankets directly. PREMIUM MATERIAL The weighted blanket is made of 100% breathable natural cotton, which would make it cooler and more durable than normal blanket. The filling is environmental non-glue polyester padding and Hypo-allergenic,non-toxic,odorless Glass Beads. NEW PROCESS We improved our technology step by step. The new process can make the square much smaller, which would make weight distributed evenly inside the blanket. The updated process would fix the problem that the glass beads move massive around inside the blanket. To prevent the glass beads leakage, we add two layer microfiber inside, which is also breathable and would not make it hot. REMINDER Some people are not recommended to use the weighted blanket. Physically weak people do not recommend using this blanket, Or choose lighter weight blanket. Pregnant women, babies and sick patient are prohibited to use. Please do not use it for children under 5 years old.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Z5vKpFTuL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cieltown","source_asin":"B07L79R9QK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1046086","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L79R9QK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L79R9QK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
