window.products.push({"id":1046191,"name":"ORIDOM Extra Large Bamboo Cutting Board with Compartments and Juice Groove - Thick Serving Tray for Kitchen and Dining, Heavy Butcher Block Chopping B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HeXYtZFsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multiple Benefits of Premium Bamboo: This 100% organic bamboo cutting board is 17.3 x 13.3\" and 0.7\" in thickness. Well-polished natural dense bamboo cutting board has a smooth and durable surface that is knife-friendly and resists knife scarring to withstand everyday use. Naturally heat and water resistant bamboo chopping board will not easily wrap or crack. Elegant texture and two-tone color to blend in with your dining table and kitchen decor, perfect for the warm family gathering vibe. Well-designed to keep Your Kitchen Countertop Clean: This cutting board has 3 built-in compartments on one side to temporarily store diced veggies or needed seasonings. No more bowls or plates to save space and improve efficiency. Deep juice groove on the other side to prevent liquids like water, juice or grease from spilling during food prep and dish serving. Grooved handles are convenient for you to transfer this chopping board as well as serving tray from kitchen to grill and dinning table. Discover Gourmet Chef in Yourself: Combine the art of food prep and dish serving into one with our kitchen chopping board. Not only a butcher block for cutting, chopping, dicing or slicing, but also a serving tray with handles for dish serving and food presentation due to fine bamboo grain that conveys modern elegance. Extra large cutting board is great for holding sliced beef, grilled kebabs and roasted turkey to entertain your family and friends on festival feasts. Easy Clean & Low Maintenance: We always recommend to wash your bamboo chopping board with mild soapy water, then wipe it down with a damp cloth and airy dry. Never let it soak in water or put it in a dishwasher. We also recommend to oil the bamboo chopping block about once every month with food grade mineral oil to keep the good looking and extend the service life. No worry about unpleasant odor or stain for years of use. Perfect Gift Idea: Crafted with natural bamboo which is a highly renewable and earth friendly resource, our versatile cutting board featuring beauty, durability, health and sanitation is a great gift for Father's Day, Mother's Day, Thanksgiving Day, Christmas for Couples, Engaging and Wedding Shower Party, Housewarming Party, etc. Your satisfaction is our #1 priority - 24/7 customer service stands by. If you have any problem, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HeXYtZFsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"oridom","source_asin":"B0977G2KVP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1046191","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0977G2KVP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0977G2KVP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
