window.products.push({"id":1046249,"name":"Croscill Home Fashions Mystique Scalloped Valance, 75-Inch by 16-Inch, Claret","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l9MiHA5EL._AC_SL1410_.jpg","description":"A refreshing combination of traditional luxury and modern drama is offered in the beautiful Mystique large-scale formal paisley pattern, paired with relaxed plaid in an opulent claret color story. The comforter is claret chenille with dramatic large-scale paisley jacquard, twist cord trim detail and woven reverse.  Shams coordinate directly with the comforter face, with two-inch padded flange and twist cord trim. The 18\" bedskirt is solid gold with velvet ribbon accent and box kick pleats.  The Euro shams are reversible with plaid on one side and golden matelassé on the other. The square pillow coordinates with the face of the euro shams, featuring the relaxed plaid fabric and twist-cord trim. The fashion pillow features fine detailing, with an engineered paisley motif in the center framed by woven gimp and blocks of matelassé and shirred satin fabric, finished with twist-cord trim. The boudoir pillow features a large rectangle of matelassé fabric in the center, framed by sections of the main paisley fabric, with added decorative gimp accenting and tassel fringe on either side. Mystique window treatments include lined jacquard panels with tiebacks and a scalloped valance with tassel fringe, all in the beautiful claret chenille paisley design. To achieve the featured look, use two valances. Coordinating Mystique sheets of opulent gold are 300TC, 100-Percent cotton with 16\" pockets and feature tasteful medallion embroidery along the hems. Euro shams, decorative pillows, sheet sets, and drapes and valances are sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l9MiHA5EL._AC_SL1410_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crocsill","source_asin":"B008YB1NQC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1046249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008YB1NQC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008YB1NQC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1046250,"name":"All-Clad Stainless Steel Paella Pan with Lid Cookware, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31CW670BCWL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description This 13-inch round pan with its flat lid is perfect for cooking and serving paella. All-Clad Stainless features three-ply stainless-steel layers that sandwich pure a aluminum core for even heating. The stay-cool handles are riveted for strength and comfort. All-Clad Stainless is dishwasher safe, but hand washing recommended. Lifetime warranty against defects. Made in the USA. Amazon.com The bestseller among All-Clad's renowned cookware collections, the Stainless line provides serious and professional cooks all the virtues that make All-Clad's worldwide reputation unsurpassed. Key to its high performance is a three-ply, bonded construction. Sandwiched between layers of stainless steel is a thick core of pure aluminum that spreads heat evenly across the bottoms of pots and pans and all the way up the sides. The interior is highly polished 18/10 stainless steel, so it's stick-resistant as well as stain- and corrosion-resistant. The exterior is gleaming, magnetic stainless steel that works on induction as well as conventional stovetops, and, with care, remains beautiful during this cookware's lifetime warranty against defects--and beyond. This round paella pan makes clear why All-Clad's Stainless line is so popular. It's 13 inches in diameter and 2-1/4 inches deep, has a lid that's perfect for cooking paella, and is beautiful enough for serving. Equally useful for braising lamb shanks or tossing rigatoni with ragu Bolognese and bringing it to the table, this pan has polished 18/10 stainless-steel handles that are riveted to the pan for strength, stay cool on the stovetop, but won't be harmed by an oven's highest heat. Although Stainless cookware is dishwasher-safe, hand washing is recommended. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31CW670BCWL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"All-Clad","source_asin":"B00005AL6E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1046250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005AL6E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005AL6E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
