window.products.push({"id":1046282,"name":"Robot Vacuum, Deenkee WiFi/App/Alexa Robot Vacuum Cleaner,3-IN-1 and 120 Mins Runtime 6 Cleaning Modes,Smart Navigation & Sensor & Map,Self-Charging,Q","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EWXOszVFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[WIFI & APP & Alexa & Google Assistant & Remote Control] : Designed for those who likes easy operation.You can set cleaning schedule , change cleaning modes easily via DEENKEE APP and Remote Control. Deenkee DK700 robot vacuum cleaner is also compatible with Alexa and Google Assistant, allowing users to make the robot start and stop the clean by voice commands. (DEENKEE robot vacuum cleaner packed with APP install manual ). [120 Mins Long Life Battery & Self Charging]: Lasts up to 120 minutes run time for 1291 sqft which means that even large houses can be cleaned in one go. DEENKEE DK700 robot vacuum will return to charging base automatically at the end of a cleaning cycle or when its battery is running low, ensuring it’s always charged and ready to clean. [6 Cleaning Modes & Auto Boost Technology]: Deenkee Robotic Vacuum supports 6 cleaning modes including auto, spot, moping, edge, single room, schedule. you can customize your cleaning routine for a better clean. The robot vacuum cleaner auto-adjust Cleaning Head and increases suction power when clean carpets to get the best clean. [Smart 3-IN-1 Vacuuming & Mopping & Sweeping]:One Robot has two options. Deenkee Robotic vacuum cleaner provides Sweeping & Vacuuming function and Sweeping & Mopping function.Vacuuming system provides a powerful suction in vacuum mode. Mopping and Sweeping system with intelligent control water tank. ( Water tank are not included in the robot vacuum package.) [2.75\"Slim Body &Anti-drop Sensor]: With slim 2.75\" body and 12.8'' diameter, DEENKEE robot vacuum can slides under and around bed, sofa, and other furniture for a thoroughly clean with high coverage. Anti-dropping sensors prevent robot vacuum cleaner from tumbling down stairs and steep drops. (Anti-dropping sensors may work less effectively if dirty or used on reflective/very dark-colored floors) [Gyroscope Navigation]: Smart Gyroscope Navigation technology navigating in \"S\" paths guarantees double efficiency compared to standard robot vacuum cleaners, helping you clean your house deeper and faster than standard robot vacuum cleaners. [What You Get]: Robot DK700,Remote Control(AAA Battery *2 included ),Charging Base,Power Adapter,Dust Bin,Additional High Performance Filter,Cleaning Tool,2*Side Brushe, Owner’s Manul& Other Documents.Professional customer service with our worry-free 12-month warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EWXOszVFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deenkee","source_asin":"B08TR2N73G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1046282","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TR2N73G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TR2N73G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
