window.products.push({"id":1046520,"name":"Picnic Blanket, 98\" x 90\" Extra Large Beach Blanket fit 8-10 Adults, Soft Foldable Outdoor Mat, Spring Summer Great for Camping & Party on Grass, Wate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KW2wP45gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌴【Chic & Fashion】Most picnics blankets are dull colors and old-fashioned plaid patterns, tedious and depressing. We tried to break this situation with light colors and trendy woven patterns. Don’t worry about stains after a full meal because this blanket is made of easy-to-clean fabric and machine washable. Brown Waterproof Mat not Included. 🌴【Extra large size & More users】This picnic blanket expands to 98\"*90\", accommodates up to 8-10 adults, and folds into a pouch using a portable belt. Ideal for socialites and large gatherings of friends. Not only suitable for camping, beach, park and outdoor concerts, but also can be used as indoor floor mat, children's play mat, pet cushion. You and your family or friends can enjoy a picnic out to the fullest. 🌴【Excellent Material】The white picnic mat is made of high-quality polyester material, which is soft and skin-friendly, comfortable and breathable. The picnic mat has a fringe design all around. This picnic mat will be the best choice when you go out camping. 🌴【Easy to fold & Use multiple times】Whether you roll it up or fold it, you'll have a very easy and effortless way to organize it. This is mainly due to the excellent material of the picnic mat. In addition, our picnic mats are machine washable to remove any meal stains and footprints. After washing, you can store your picnic mat for future use. 🌴【Seller Warm Suggestion】After each use, you can simply wipe the soil, fine sand and stains on the bottom of the picnic mat with a paper towel. This allows for better folding and preservation of the picnic mat. If the picnic encounters sudden cooling, high winds or hot sun, wrap your body in a white blanket to reduce the impact of weather conditions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KW2wP45gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiny Land","source_asin":"B09XGPFPS6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1046520","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XGPFPS6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XGPFPS6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
