window.products.push({"id":1046631,"name":"Rywell Waterproof Mattress Protector Twin Size, Arc-Chill Breathable Cooling Mattress Protector, Noiseless Bed Mattress Cover Twin Fitted Sheet, 14''-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/11RAALXqfeL._AC_.jpg","description":"【Noiseless & Waterproof】Our waterproof mattress protector features TPU backing, which is PVC, Phthalate and Vinyl free, effectively protects your mattress against all liquids and stains, helping make a clean and healthy sleeping environment. TPU backing is soft, which ensures that you won't hear a plastic noise when you move during the night. Rywell premium waterproof mattress cover will not only safeguard your mattress but also protect your good sleeping all night. 【Cooling & Breathable & Soft】Made of Arc-chill Japanese advanced cool touch technology, our cooling mattress protector has a Q-Max rating of 0.43, which will absorb the heat of the human body, lower the skin temperature, which is perfect for hot sleepers. You won’t worry about night sweats anymore! Plus, twin mattress protector adopts Japanese knitted fabric, which has passed Japan BOKEN test, more breathable, softer than normal bamboo waterproof mattress protector. 【Skin-friendly Mattress Protector】Our twin waterproof mattress protector can effectively prevent dust from passing into the mattress, which will give your a healthy sleeping environment. Besides, mattress protector is skin-friendly and no static, very suitable for baby, kids, woman, the elderly and people with a predisposition to allergies. 【360° Deep Pocket Mattress Cover】Our twin size (39\" x 79\") bed mattress cover with deep pocket will secure your mattress from 360 degrees, which will not bunch or shift on the bed, very easy to insert and replace. Deep pocket fits up to 18'' deep mattress, perfect for 14\" deep mattress. Your can turn over freely on bed. Our twin fitted sheet will not change the feel of your mattress, which can be used on all types of mattress, such as memory foam, latex and spring mattress. 【Machine Washable Mattress Protector】Rywell Cooling Mattress Protector is machine washable. We suggest you use a laundry bag, a mild detergent (free from any bleach) and water below 30 ℃ to clean it. Following washing recommended instructions will prolong your mattress protector cover’s life. We suggest you buy 2 pieces or more, so you can change one while wash the other.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/11RAALXqfeL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rywell","source_asin":"B09XTR498B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1046631","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XTR498B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XTR498B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
