window.products.push({"id":1046676,"name":"LovIT Scientific Digital Internal Meat Thermometer for Grilling and Oven Roasting - Accurate, Electronic Probe - Easy to Read","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819FldvVEAL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether you're at the backyard barbecue or checking on dinner that's roasting in the oven, every second matters. End cooking too quickly, and you can end up with underdone beef that turns off your guests or poultry and pork that's unsafe to eat. Let cooking continue too long, and your perfectly marbled steak, succulent chicken or Thanksgiving turkey becomes a dried out, leathery disaster. The secret to preparing meats like a pro is cooking them to an ideal working temperature, and with the Digital Internal Meat Thermometer for Grilling and Oven Roasting, it's easy to get foods that perfect level of doneness every time. The Digital Internal Meat Thermometer is a wireless thermometer that allows you to double check the internal temperature of foods in a flash. The 4.75-inch slim single steel probe is easy to insert into beef, poultry or pork and shows the exact temperature immediately on its crystal clear digital display that is easy to read. Once you see the temperature, refer to the storage sheath to double check if dinner's ready. The recommended cooking times for all types of meats are printed right on it for your convenience. Wireless for ease of use , the Digital Internal Meat Thermometer is powered by an AG13 battery. After it's displayed the temperature, the thermometer shuts off to preserve battery life. Fully waterproof, the electronic thermometer is very simple to clean, making it the absolute best digital meat thermometer you'll find on Amazon. When you purchase the Digital Internal Meat Thermometer for Grilling and Oven Roasting, your satisfaction is 100% guaranteed. Don't take chances with the quality of your dinner or with the safety of your family. Double check the temperature before serving in an instant with the Digital Internal Meat Thermometer for Grilling and Oven Roasting. Order yours today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819FldvVEAL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lovit Scientific","source_asin":"B00TI8M0HQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1046676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00TI8M0HQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00TI8M0HQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
